{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy 15 tracks of Southeast Asian\u2013inspired music from the chaotic co-op cooking game, <i>SEDAP! A Culinary Adventure</i>. Composed by Singaporean musicians Rebecca Tan and Nicole Kayla Lee,\u00a0the soundtrack blends traditional instruments like the <i>gamelan</i> and <i>angklung</i> with modern electronics to create a vibrant, high-energy backdrop perfect for kitchen mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726990/extras/da54dc610c8a0a0decbf34b9fee1affc.webp?t=1749126317\" width=600 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Credits:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Composer: Rebecca Tan Ting Yan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tracks 1 ~ 13</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Composer: Nicole Kayla Lee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tracks 14 ~ 15</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional kudos to Ng Wei Xuan for playing the dizi for Track 3, and to Chew Ru for producing Track 14 and Track 15.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726990/extras/da54dc610c8a0a0decbf34b9fee1affc.webp?t=1749126317\" width=600 height=45 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3726990?t=1749126317","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3726990?t=1749126317","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726990/d5b91609837eabf94c6f55ee299b6c809ebf23da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749126317","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726990/d5b91609837eabf94c6f55ee299b6c809ebf23da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749126317","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null}